# IMP-0441: EOL policy for the command-center gates.
# validate.py (REACH-6) and render.py hash text files as bytes. Git stores
# LF; a Windows working tree under core.autocrlf=true materialises CRLF,
# which made both gates unsatisfiable on the authoring box. These rules
# force LF materialisation for every hashed extension.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=lf
